OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe evening
OL,6,Fwill be mostly cloudy with outbreaks
OL,7,Fof rain in the north. The rain will
OL,8,Fspread towards the southeast,
OL,9,Fovernight. Winds brisk early evening
OL,10,Facross the western coasts and Isles,
OL,11,Fotherwise light.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FDry in the southeast at
OL,14,Ffirst, rain in the northwest will soon
OL,15,Fspread to all parts, becoming patchy
OL,16,Fand light by the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
